step	8	-	Quick guide step 8
line	<str>Talk to King Arthur.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Sir Gawain, who can be found in the courtyard to the south or nearby in the castle.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Sir Lancelot upstairs.</str>
