line	<str>Climb to the top floor. The Renegade Knights will attack you on your way up.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Attack <col=800000>Sir Mordred</col>. He cannot be safespotted, but he can be flinched using the stairs (position him on the square left of the stairs whilst flinching from the square north-east of him). He can also be killed with <col=800000>rings of recoil</col> or by another account poisoning and attacking right before his death.</col>
step	9	-	Quick guide step 9
line	<str>Talk to King Arthur.</str>
